 great viewpoint Crap la Tretscha awaits you. Enjoy peace, experience the features of the Lenzer nature and marvel at the wonderful mountain hut district Tschividains.","foto":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_748_008_F_s.jpg","foto_urls":null,"foto_master":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-master/WL_748_008_F_M.jpg","foto_big":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/WL_748_008_F_g.jpg","foto_standard":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_748_008_F_s.jpg","foto_small":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-small/WL_748_008_F_k.jpg","foto_abstract":null,"logo":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_748_GR_Senda_Crap_la_Tretscha.jpg","logo_svg":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-svg/WL_748_GR_Senda_Crap_la_Tretscha.svg","x_coordinate":761973.6592019765,"y_coordinate":173581.95654604372,"description":"The starting point of the round trip is the bus stop «Vischnanca» in Lantsch/Lenz. From there, you will follow the main road for a short distance, before you reach to the edge of the forest and you turn into the residential district Tgampi. During the summer months, a big flower meadow shines at the end of the village, enjoy the sight.\n\nThe hike leads up to the lookout point Crap la Tretscha, from where you have a magnificent view towards Oberhalbstein, Albulatal and Landwassertal. Linger at this beautiful place, grill your brought along sausages at the fireplace and relax at a picnic on the benches. After a snack, you will hike past the mountain hut district Tschividains where you can marvel at the beautiful houses, embedded in a wonderful landscape.\n\nThe varied forest path runs along the golf course to the underpass, which takes you back to Lantsch/Lenz.","length":7,"length_asphalt":null,"length_unsurfaced":null,"length_singletrail":null,"height_difference":200,"height_difference_back":200,"height_downwards":null,"hiking_time":1.9166666,"hiking_time_back":1.8333334,"category_grade":"easy","category_grade_text":"hiking trail","category_grade_skii